        "description": "Opened the actual 945 x 380 source PNG before authoring. Left subfigure, approximately x=14..388 and y=116..301: exactly two cuboid/cube-like blocks on one thin perspective platform. Large block is on the left, small block on the right. Both show an unmarked front, a top, and a diagonally hatched right face; their front bottoms share the platform. Large front is about 132 x 136 source pixels, small front about 41 x 44; these rough drawn dimensions are not a calibrated physical scale. No source dimension, volume, mass, material word, number, unit, arrow, axis, grid, person or weight occurs in (a). The prose identifies the large left object as ice and the smaller right one as iron, with equal mass, NOT equal volume.",
